@startuml

title Extensible Processing Methods in PULSE

left to right direction

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam linetype polyline

skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
    BorderColor #303030
    ArrowColor #202020
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
    BorderColor #707070
}

class Pulse {
    - confidence_method : ConfidenceMethod
    - cat_to_vad_method : CatToVadMethod
    - fusion_method : FusionMethod
    - affective_observations : List

    + Pulse(confidence_method,\n  cat_to_vad_method,\n  fusion_method)
    + process_observations()
}

abstract class ConfidenceMethod <<Strategy>> {
    + estimate(observations) : List
}

class EntropyConfidenceMethod <<Provided Implementation>> {
    + estimate(observations) : List
}

abstract class CatToVadMethod <<Strategy>> {
    + convert(observations) : List
}

class ReferenceBasedCatToVadMethod <<Provided Implementation>> {
    - VAD_REFERENCE : Map
    + convert(observations) : List
}

abstract class FusionMethod <<Strategy>> {
    + fuse(observations) : VADState
}

class WeightedFusionMethod <<Provided Implementation>> {
    + fuse(observations) : VADState
}

ConfidenceMethod <|-- EntropyConfidenceMethod
CatToVadMethod <|-- ReferenceBasedCatToVadMethod
FusionMethod <|-- WeightedFusionMethod

Pulse --> ConfidenceMethod : injected method
Pulse --> CatToVadMethod : injected method
Pulse --> FusionMethod : injected method

note top of Pulse
The concrete processing methods
are supplied through the constructor.

Pulse depends only on the
abstract method contracts.
end note

note bottom of ConfidenceMethod
Extension point for confidence
estimation methods.
end note

note bottom of CatToVadMethod
Extension point for CAT-to-VAD
conversion methods.

The conversion is applied only
to CAT observations.
end note

note bottom of FusionMethod
Extension point for multimodal
fusion methods.
end note

note bottom
Additional implementations may inherit
from ConfidenceMethod, CatToVadMethod,
or FusionMethod without modifying Pulse.
end note

legend bottom
  <|--  Generalization: inheritance
  -->   Association: stores or uses an injected object

  <<Strategy>>
  Abstract interchangeable processing contract

  <<Provided Implementation>>
  Concrete implementation included in the framework
endlegend

@enduml